            "review_text": "Play5354\nAdelaide, Australia10 contributions\n0\nGreat spot\nApr 2018 • Couples\nPerfect blend of small share plates. \nMake sure you try the Tuna carpaccio, flaming saganaki cheese and the pork belly !!\n\nWhen you are tired of the bread rolls and noodle soups of Saigon. \n\nTry this place. \nHigh quality. \nClean and great service. \n\nLook forward to coming back and trying out the rest of the menu\nRead more\nWritten April 3, 2018",
