            "review_text": "PRIYANK S\nSingapore, Singapore15 contributions\n0\nGem in Saigon\nMar 2018 • Couples\nThe food is a reminder of what you can do if you put your heart into what you love! The tapas are awesome with an Asian twist , the service is impeccable. Patata Bravas and chickpea spinach was like we were back in Spain. The flaming saganaki is to die for. If you passby Saigon don't miss this place. The manager is a cool English guy who loves to serve!\nRead more\nWritten March 31, 2018",
