            "review_title": "Review at Fork Saigon",
            "review_text": "Titti Ringström\nLoderup, Sweden54 contributions\n0\nSaigon's best restaurant\nMar 2018 • Couples\nTorget all about the Tapas you have had before. At Fork the Tapas are lifted to a very New dimension. The fishes you are served are beyond delicious. Don't miss the fresh tuna with spets and olive oil or the goat cheese tills. Not to mention the desserts they are heavenly. The wine list is also very impressive\n\nIf you are lucky the owner, Tony will be there. He is so frendly and knows everything with kosing about the city and it's surroundings.\nRead more\nWritten March 17, 2018",
