            "review_text": "MuswellMum\n19 contributions\n0\nNicest tapas in Ho Chi Minh\nFeb 2018 • Family\nWe came here after looking on trip advisor for local restaurants and it stood out. The service is great and the manager is interacting with the customers. The atmosphere is also very warm and inviting, you could spend all night chatting. Definitely a place to come if you’re looking for a change from the local cuisine. As well as the service the food is absolutely luxurious, the tuna and lamb were incredibly melt in the mouth. I would also recommend the meatballs and the patatas bravas which were heavenly.\nRead more\nWritten February 11, 2018",
