            "review_text": "Wynetta T\nFriesland Province, The Netherlands15 contributions\n0\nLovely little restaurant!\nJan 2018 • Couples\nWe were just passing by and decided to try this little restaurant. It worked out wonderful. We had some lovely dishes, all of them freshly made and for a reasonable privé.\nAnd the great variety of wines (by the glas and bottle) is amazing.\nWe were deeply impressed and will come back soon hopefully!! The staff was very helpfull and friendly.\nRead more\nWritten January 2, 2018",
