            "review_text": "Tranelman\nPhnom Penh, Cambodia85 contributions\n0\nFood lovers paradise\nDec 2017 • Friends\nIf you love Tapas, Croquettes, Cold Cuts, Fish, Meats, Vegetables and Desserts, you will absolutely love FORK. We went as a group of 12 people so we ordered just about everything on the menu. Some of the outstanding choices were the Korean Spiced Salmon kimchee blinis, Prosciutto Wrapped Camembert, Burrata Crostini, Octopus Ajillo, Lamb Koftas, and amazing Crispy Pork Belly. The Flourless Chocolate cake and Cinnamon Creme Brulee was also enjoyed by all. The selection of white and red wines by the glass is huge. The staff was friendly and efficient, so a great night was had by all. This is a must try destination as you will not be disappointed.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 21, 2017",
