            "review_text": "Angiechina24\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nTony Fox Has Done It Again\nDec 2017 • Friends\nThis review is late as we have just past our 15th visit to Fork, Tony Fox's most recent culinary creation, and, like Ciao Bella, he does not disappoint! Whether ordering from the menu or his handcrafted adventures from the blackboard you will not go wrong. The home made blood sausage with a chicken liver sauce, that would bring tears of joy to the eyes of Anthony Bourdain, is to die for! And to complete the evening - if you are lucky - would be owner/creator himself joining your table briefly for a drink and a laugh. So, all I have to say is that if you have not yet experienced Tony's newest creation...then Fork you! :)\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 16, 2017",
